---
layout: norn-base.webc
title: Component kit
description: The small components, one of each.
---
<h1>Component kit</h1>
<norn-breadcrumb-nav :@items="[{ url: '/', title: 'Home' }, { url: '/docs/one/', title: 'Docs' }, { url: '/kit/', title: 'Component kit' }]"></norn-breadcrumb-nav>
<norn-search @bundle="/assets/pagefind/pagefind.js" @site="example.com"></norn-search>
<norn-page-toc :@items="[{ id: 'anchors', text: 'Anchors', level: 2 }, { id: 'deeper', text: 'Deeper', level: 3 }]"></norn-page-toc>
<norn-heading-anchor @slug="anchors">Anchors</norn-heading-anchor>
<norn-heading-anchor @slug="deeper" :@level="3">Deeper</norn-heading-anchor>
<h2>Color scheme</h2>
<norn-theme-toggle></norn-theme-toggle>
<norn-theme-toggle><span slot="label">Scheme, again</span></norn-theme-toggle>
<h2>Icons</h2>
<p id="icons"><norn-svg-icon @name="warning"><span slot="label">Warning</span></norn-svg-icon> Labeled. <norn-svg-icon @name="arrow-end"></norn-svg-icon> Decorative.</p>
<p id="project-icon"><norn-svg-icon @name="badge"><span slot="label">Badge</span></norn-svg-icon> Project icon.</p>
<p dir="rtl" id="rtl">التالي <norn-svg-icon @name="arrow-end"></norn-svg-icon></p>
<h2>Link buttons</h2>
<p>
	<norn-link-button @href="/docs/one/">Read the docs <norn-svg-icon @name="arrow-end"></norn-svg-icon></norn-link-button>
	<norn-link-button @href="https://example.com/source" @variant="quiet">Source</norn-link-button>
</p>
<h2>Tags</h2>
<norn-tag-list>
	<li><norn-svg-icon @name="check"></norn-svg-icon>Node 24+</li>
	<li>No runtime dependencies</li>
</norn-tag-list>
<p><a href="#icons">Jump to icons <span class="visually-hidden">on this page</span></a></p>
<h2>Nested navigation</h2>
<norn-side-nav :@items="[{ url: '/docs/one/', title: 'Docs', icon: 'book', children: [{ url: '/kit/', title: 'Kit' }, { url: '/plain/', title: 'Plain' }] }, { url: '/', title: 'Home' }]">
	<span slot="label">Guides</span>
</norn-side-nav>
<h2>Notices</h2>
<norn-page-notice @severity="success">
	<p>Saved. The changes apply on the next build.</p>
	<norn-link-button slot="action" @href="/docs/one/" @variant="quiet">Open the docs</norn-link-button>
</norn-page-notice>
<norn-page-notice @severity="error" :@live="true">
	<p>The build failed.</p>
</norn-page-notice>
<h2>Call-outs</h2>
<norn-call-out>
	<p>A note, with the default title.</p>
</norn-call-out>
<norn-call-out @variant="caution">
	<span slot="heading">Careful</span>
	<p>A caution with its own title.</p>
</norn-call-out>
<h2>Questions</h2>
<norn-accordion-group>
	<details name="faq">
		<summary>Does it need a script?</summary>
		<p>No. The browser opens and closes each section.</p>
	</details>
	<details name="faq">
		<summary>Can two be open?</summary>
		<p>Not when they share a name.</p>
	</details>
</norn-accordion-group>
<h2>Line breaks inside the tags</h2>
<norn-segmented-control @legend="Size" @name="size" :@options="[{ value: 's', label: 'Small', checked: true }, { value: 'l', label: 'Large' }]">
</norn-segmented-control>
<p id="install">npm install @example/project</p>
<norn-copy-button @source="install">
</norn-copy-button>
